# The image is built from four things: pyproject.toml, uv.lock, src/ and the
# two files the package metadata names. Ignore everything, then allow those,
# so nothing else can reach the build context by accident -- least of all a
# local state directory or a Terraform working directory.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
src/**/__pycache__/
